From 6dfa8ed2f9a8ac6cb8895a206e6d17827161e345 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kas User <kas@example.com>
Date: Thu, 1 May 2025 15:28:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] add moducop ignition shutdown handler with char dev

---
