 drivers/power/reset/Makefile           |   1 +
 drivers/power/reset/moducop-ignition.c | 186 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 193 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/power/reset/moducop-ignition.c

